diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 542867154d33ae94839e0a8c66685c8a22eaf9e6..7c1f2b9e4bd62ab3d6e9c28b33a571cb35d49f41 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -27,3 +27,6 @@ import { applyPatch } from "json-toolkit";
 applyPatch({ users: ["Ada"] }, [{ op: "add", path: "/users/-", value: "Grace" }]);
 // { users: ["Ada", "Grace"] }
 ```
+
+Both inputs must be JSON values. Operations are evaluated in order and processing stops at the first
+RFC 6902 error; because the input document is never changed, a failed patch leaves it intact.
