@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@
+---
+id: task-003-conform-json-patch-to-rfc-6902
+type: task
+title: "Conform JSON Patch to RFC 6902"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Work completed
+
+Validated JSON Patch input as JSON and required `op`, `path`, and `from`
+members to be own members of operation objects. `move` now verifies its source
+exists even when source and destination paths are identical.
+
+Added regression tests for inherited/non-JSON operation objects, identity moves
+with missing sources, and source-document immutability when a later operation
+fails. Documented sequential error handling and input immutability in the README.
